{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t內地海關總署公布，今年首3季，貨物貿易進出口39.94萬億元人民幣，按年增長18.8%。其中，出口增長16.4%，進口增長22.3%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n9月進出口按年增長27.5%，連續6個月保持雙位數增長。其中，出口增長29.6%，進口增長24.6%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n海關總署新聞發言人、副署長王軍表示，今年首3季中國外貿有效應對各種外部衝擊挑戰，認為今季進出口持續增長有基礎、有支撐。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.954710+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:08:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:19.963349+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:19.963349+00:00","content_hash":"9217d667d8ec445a2ec70cb40ae59382b44135a2bb827c7bf77c84e2e6f95546","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}